I have just started to learn about lojban. As of now, I have read all<br>
of &quot;What is Lojban&quot; and am making my way through the reference<br=
>
grammar. I am very interested in this language for multiple reasons:<br>
logicalness, well laid out grammar, and spelling (having had to change<br>
some of this post because I couldn&#39;t remember how to spell a few words<=
br>
